WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.549
In this video, we introduce “Fruit Salad”
a group game to make class more fun, boost

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:12.360
energy and allow students to get to know each
other better.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:18.390
Teachers can play the game with kids 8 years
or older and with group size from 8 to 30.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:25.920
One session can take 5 to 30 minutes and all
you need is a room and some chairs.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.750
Start with all students sitting in a circle
and the student with the most recent birthday

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.369
standing in the middle.

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:39.760
Then the student standing asks the questions
that can be answered with yes or no.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.240
Younger children might ask: Do you like vanilla
ice cream?

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.930
Or do you like to get up early?

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:52.329
Older players are often more personal like
did you ever kiss anyone?

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:56.480
Did you ever do something that your parents
would not allow?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:02.809
All students who have answered questions with
yes, get up immediately and try to find a

00:01:02.809 --> 00:01:06.080
new chair without speaking their answers out
loud.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.530
They can pick any chairs except their own
or the one right next to them.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:15.319
While everybody is up, looking for a new seat.

00:01:15.319 --> 00:01:20.109
The aim of the player in the middle is to
catch a free chair.

00:01:20.109 --> 00:01:27.079
The player who doesn’t catch a chair is
next to stand in the middle and ask a question.

00:01:27.079 --> 00:01:32.170
If the player in the middle cannot think of
any spontaneous questions, he simply shouts

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:34.249
“Fruit Salad”!

00:01:34.249 --> 00:01:36.709
And all the kids get up and change places.

00:01:36.709 --> 00:01:44.420
The game is fast to set up, fun to play and
students love it because we get to know each

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:45.420
other better.

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:50.189
If you are a teacher, please give it a try
and tell us how it works for you.

00:01:50.189 --> 00:01:55.099
If you are a student or parent, ask your teacher
to give it a try.

